# BUILD AN AWS CERTIFIED AI PRACTITIONER AIF-C01 EXAM MASTERY SYSTEM

You are building a **personal exam-preparation application for me**, the only user.

My objective is to become as thoroughly prepared as possible for the **AWS Certified AI Practitioner (AIF-C01)** certification exam.

This is NOT a commercial application.

This is NOT a generic quiz app.

This is a **personal exam-training system** whose job is to expose what I don't know, repeatedly test it, track my mistakes, and keep training me until I demonstrate consistent mastery of the available material.

---

