```

Exam readiness should consider:

* Overall accuracy
* Topic accuracy
* Weak question count
* Repeated mistakes
* Mastered questions
* Performance on mixed questions
* Performance on timed exams
* Recent performance
* Consistency across multiple sessions

Do not allow a single good score to make me "Exam Ready."

